---
---
<section class="reveal-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
    <div class="glass-card p-8 mt-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-6">
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Business Analyst Intern</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-200 text-lg mt-1">Healthium Medtech Limited</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-base text-gray-300 mt-3 md:mt-0 border border-white/20 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">Mar 2023 &ndash; Aug 2023</span>
        </div>

        <!-- KPI row -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="text-center p-5 rounded-xl bg-white/8 border border-white/15">
                <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-white count-up" data-target="70" data-suffix="%">0%</div>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mt-2 leading-snug">Reduction in data<br/>gathering time</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-5 rounded-xl bg-white/8 border border-white/15">
                <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-white count-up" data-target="60" data-suffix=" min">0 min</div>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mt-2 leading-snug">Daily saved via<br/>automation</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-5 rounded-xl bg-white/8 border border-white/15">
                <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-white">5 mo</div>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mt-2 leading-snug">Internship<br/>duration</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-100 text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white font-bold mt-0.5">&rarr;</span> Automated SAP-HANA data extraction using Python, Excel &amp; SQL &mdash; cutting <strong class="text-white">70%</strong> of data gathering time.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white font-bold mt-0.5">&rarr;</span> Built real-time updating Power BI &amp; Excel dashboards for data-driven decision making.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white font-bold mt-0.5">&rarr;</span> Automated daily report mailing to all department heads via Microsoft Automate &mdash; saving <strong class="text-white">60 min/day</strong>.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
            {["SAP-HANA", "Python", "SQL", "Excel", "Power BI", "Microsoft Automate"].map(tag => (
                <span class="px-4 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-medium">{tag}</span>
            ))}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
